lood. Nobody has ever seen a male mangler.","abilities":[],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.7,"stats":{"hp":4600,"atk":450,"def":100,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":1.5}},"elite_infected_patrol_captain":{"slug":"elite_infected_patrol_captain","name":"Elite Infected Patrol Captain","icon":"/enemies-icons/Elite Infected Patrol Captain.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A high-ranking officer tasked with hunting the Infected of Ursus. Greedy and cold-blooded. They are not a part of the army, and are generally despised by Ursus soldiers and city officials alike.","abilities":["Can use long-ranged weapons to attack <Ursus Civilians> and <Talulah, the Fighter>"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":1.1,"stats":{"hp":4300,"atk":400,"def":150,"res":20,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2}},"elite_ursus_armored_caster":{"slug":"elite_ursus_armored_caster","name":"Elite Ursus Armored Caster","icon":"/enemies-icons/Elite Ursus Armored Caster.webp","rank":"Normal","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Arts"],"flavourText":"A basic caster in the Ursus Army who has displayed excellence. They are clad in armor and wield more powerful Arts.","abilities":[],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.9,"stats":{"hp":6500,"atk":420,"def":500,"res":50,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":2.8}},"imperial_striker":{"slug":"imperial_striker","name":"Imperial Striker","icon":"/enemies-icons/Imperial Striker.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee and Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"The powerful infantry of the Ursus Army, the backbone of the Imperial Army's aggressive advance. They are versatile in offense and defense, melee and ranged. After sustain a certain amount of damage, their morale will peak, causing them to inflict more destruction.","abilities":["Gains significantly increased ATK when HP is under 50%"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":12000,"atk":900,"def":800,"res":50,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4.5}},"elite_imperial_striker":{"slug":"elite_imperial_striker","name":"Elite Imperial Striker","icon":"/enemies-icons/Elite Imperial Striker.webp","rank":"Elite","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee and Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"The powerful, battle-tested infantry of the Ursus Army, the backbone of the Imperial Army's aggressive advance. They are versatile in offense and defense, melee and ranged. After sustain a certain amount of damage, their morale will peak, causing them to inflict more destruction. Along with the Shieldguards, they formed the front line of the Ursus Army.","abilities":["Gains significantly increased ATK when HP is under 50%"],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.7,"stats":{"hp":15000,"atk":1200,"def":800,"res":50,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4.5}},"imperial_artillery_core_targeteer":{"slug":"imperial_artillery_core_targeteer","name":"Imperial Artillery Core Targeteer","icon":"/enemies-icons/Imperial Artillery Core Targeteer.webp","rank":"Elite","race":"Drone","movement":"Flying","attackPosition":"Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"A heavily-armored, sturdily-built core drone operated by artillery technicians of the Ursus army. They presage the withering firepower of the Ursus Artillery. The Ursus Artillery is a fire team that has bunkered down into the city. Though packing less firepower than naval guns, their equipment still shreds through buildings and armor with ease.","abilities":["Flying unit."],"levelCount":1,"level":0,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.5,"stats":{"hp":16000,"atk":1200,"def":800,"res":50,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":5}},"emperors_blade_pursuer":{"slug":"emperors_blade_pursuer","name":"'Emperor's Blade', Pursuer","icon":"/enemies-icons/'Emperor's Blade', Pursuer.webp","rank":"Boss","race":null,"movement":"Ground","attackPosition":"Melee and Ranged","damageType":["Physical"],"flavourText":"He once ravaged the demons of the Northern Tundra, segregating the outsiders beyond the reach of civilization; His blade shies not from royals nor nobles, safeguarding glory from the dusts of rebellion. Every Royal Guard is as a dominion; the land beneath their feet is all the territory of Ursus.","abilities":["First Form","Whenever a certain percentage of HP is lost, unleashes the permanent terrain effect [Dominion], significantly reducing allied units' ASPD and reducing Physical and Arts damage taken by self when within its effect (Prioritizes targeting the ally unit outside of [Dominion] that has dealt the most damage to this unit)","[Collapsing Fear] Deals Arts damage to nearby units, instantly defeating targets within [Dominion]","The first time HP drops to 0, casts [Collapsing Fear] on the entire battlefield and enters Second Form","Second Form","Gains increased ATK and a melee attack that deals more damage","Whenever a low percentage of HP is lost, unleashes the permanent terrain effect [Dominion]"],"levelCount":2,"level":1,"levelAssumed":false,"statsOverridden":false,"moveSpeed":0.6,"stats":{"hp":40000,"atk":700,"def":400,"res":40,"elementalRes":null,"elementalDamageRes":null,"attackInterval":4}}},"dropIcons":{"4002":"/item-icons/originite_prime.png"},"previewFile":"wd-ex-8.webp","emergency":null,"devices":[],"playbackPaths":{"0":{"points":[[6,8],[6,7],[6,6],[6,5],[6,4],[6,3],[6,2],[6,1]],"distances":[0,1,2,3,4,5,6,7],"length":7,"breaks":[],"flying":false,"holds":[],"nodes":[[6,8],[